    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RnGesus Slayer: It's Slay the Spire meets slot machine! <br><br><strong>RnGesus Slayer</strong> is a roguelike deckbuilder where you have <strong>3 separate decks</strong> and cards are dealt by <strong>spinning a slot machine</strong>! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007890/extras/3e5abc4a5e2f8afa71388067db2c59d0.poster.avif?t=1754322492\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007890/extras/3e5abc4a5e2f8afa71388067db2c59d0.webm?t=1754322492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007890/extras/3e5abc4a5e2f8afa71388067db2c59d0.mp4?t=1754322492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards with <strong>similar type</strong> when land will <strong>combo</strong> together to create an <strong>upgraded version</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007890/extras/7b0b46d01cac0f469ee18929e8978455.poster.avif?t=1754322492\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007890/extras/7b0b46d01cac0f469ee18929e8978455.webm?t=1754322492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007890/extras/7b0b46d01cac0f469ee18929e8978455.mp4?t=1754322492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>weapons cards</strong> to attack the minions of the godess, <strong>magic cards</strong> to gain mana to use spells, and<strong> gold cards</strong> to buy upgrades to your decks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007890/extras/9aa6889aad4da57c66bfcfbc22c90261.poster.avif?t=1754322492\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007890/extras/9aa6889aad4da57c66bfcfbc22c90261.webm?t=1754322492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007890/extras/9aa6889aad4da57c66bfcfbc22c90261.mp4?t=1754322492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of <strong>unique spells</strong> to kill the enemies, upgrade your hands/decks or rig the slot-machine to your advantage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007890/extras/c22b14bb4a11473735f353e908098f18.poster.avif?t=1754322492\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007890/extras/c22b14bb4a11473735f353e908098f18.webm?t=1754322492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007890/extras/c22b14bb4a11473735f353e908098f18.mp4?t=1754322492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique spell and power system, with over 35+ spells, 15+ powers and 45+ enemies to fight</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007890/extras/8636d463ac670bcdbd348bed057ab964.poster.avif?t=1754322492\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007890/extras/8636d463ac670bcdbd348bed057ab964.w